{
  "schema": 1,
  "about": "How a menu the Avaia drive in nilx-one/core offers (its `choose` command) is put to a local model and read back. Owned by nilx-one/ai (src/choice.rs); nilx-one/web keeps a byte-identical copy at packages/product-app/src/features/map/drive-choice.json and tests its own port against it. Change it here first.",
