      "prompt": "You are standing, rested enough to go out.\nOptions:\n0: stay here\n1: go out to a park (far)\n2: go out to a museum (near, you love it)\n3: go out to an archaeological site (near, new to you)\n4: wander a short way along the paths\n5: go home (near)\nAnswer with one number.",
